## Phase 11.9: CSS Nesting
Spec Reference: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-nesting-1/
Prerequisites: Phase 6 (CSS Parser), Phase 11.7.2 (Consume_Style_Block_Contents)

### 11.9.1 Nesting Selector (&) ✓
- [x] Parse <delim-token> with value "&" as nesting selector
- [x] NestingSelector type (CSS/Selector/)
- [x] Nesting selector represents the parent rule's selector list
- [x] Handle & at any position in compound selector: &.class, .class&, &::before
- [x] Tests for NestingSelector (24 tests passing)

### 11.9.2 Nested Style Rules
- [ ] Allow style rules inside other style rules
- [ ] Nested rule parsing in Consume_Style_Block_Contents
- [ ] Implicit & prepending when nested selector doesn't start with &
- [ ] Relative selector handling (> .child, + .sibling)

### 11.9.3 Nested Group Rules
- [ ] Allow @media, @supports, @layer, @scope inside style rules
- [ ] Conditional rules inherit parent's selector context
- [ ] Proper scoping of nested conditional rules

### 11.9.4 Selector Specificity
- [ ] & inherits specificity of parent selector
- [ ] :is() wrapping for implicit & (specificity calculation)
- [ ] Multiple & in same selector (specificity stacking)

### 11.9.5 Serialization
- [ ] Serialize nested rules with proper indentation
- [ ] Round-trip: parse → serialize → parse = same result
- [ ] Flatten nested rules to non-nested form (optional)

